"a080|Gift Idea Vault|Social / Gifts|flutter|camera|clay|Capture gift ideas the moment someone mentions them, and never panic-shop again.|Add a note whenever someone mentions wanting something. The app resurfaces it before their birthday.|Capturing in the moment is the whole product, and it is why note apps fail at this.|Endless: everyone in your life, forever.|Capture timing is the actual problem, and solving it is the entire product.|social,gifts,memory,occasions",
"a081|Birthday Reminder with Budget|Social / Occasions|flutter|tap|pastel|Birthdays, with a gift budget and a plan, not just a notification.|The app tracks birthdays, gift ideas and spending, and reminds you early enough to act.|Reminding early enough to actually do something is the difference from a calendar.|Endless: every year, everyone you know.|Timing the reminder to when action is possible is the key insight.|social,birthdays,budget,reminders",
"a082|Thank You Note Tracker|Social / Manners|flutter|typing|paper|Track who you should thank, and draft the note so it actually gets sent.|Log gifts and kindnesses, then the app drafts a specific, personal thank-you you can edit.|Drafting a specific note beats a template, and specificity is what makes it real.|Endless: every occasion.|Drafting assistance is what converts intention into action.|social,manners,writing,drafts",
"a083|Relationship Maintenance|Social / Connection|flutter|tap|watercolor|Keep in touch with the people who matter, at a cadence that suits each relationship.|Set a cadence per person. The app surfaces who is due, with context from your last conversation.|Per-relationship cadence beats a uniform reminder, because relationships differ.|Endless: everyone you know, forever.|Personalising the cadence is what makes this feel human rather than automated.|social,relationships,reminders,crm",
