"a085|Difficult Conversation Prep|Social / Communication|flutter|typing|ink|Prepare for a hard conversation by rehearsing the parts you are avoiding.|The app structures your preparation: what you need, what they need, and what you will do if it goes badly.|Structuring preparation for the worst case is what makes hard conversations survivable.|Endless: every hard conversation.|Rehearsal and preparation are teachable, and almost nobody is taught.|social,communication,preparation,conflict",
