"a087|Salary Benchmark (Private)|Work / Money|flutter|tap|terminal|Find out what you should be paid, without telling anyone what you currently earn.|Anonymous contribution of salary data with verification, and a benchmark by role, region and experience.|Privacy-preserving data contribution is the key to getting honest numbers.|Endless: every role, every market, updated continuously.|Solving the privacy problem is what unlocks the data.|work,salary,data,privacy",
"a088|Meeting Notes to Actions|Work / Productivity|flutter|voice|terminal|Record a meeting, get actions and owners, and nothing else.|The app transcribes, extracts decisions and action items, and discards the rest.|Discarding the transcript is a feature, because nobody reads transcripts.|Endless: every meeting.|Aggressive summarisation is more valuable than complete transcription.|work,meetings,automation,summaries",
