"a090|Screenshot to Task|Productivity / Capture|flutter|camera|minimal|Screenshots are where intentions go to die. This turns them into tasks.|The app reads screenshots, extracts the actionable content and creates tasks with links back.|Screenshots are an untapped inbox, and nobody processes them.|Endless: every screenshot.|Mining an existing behaviour for value is a strong product insight.|productivity,screenshots,tasks,automation",
"a091|Inbox Zero Coach|Productivity / Email|flutter|tap|neon|A coach that teaches you to handle email instead of an app that handles it for you.|The app watches your patterns and coaches you on rules, filters and habits, then gets out of the way.|Teaching instead of automating leaves you better off when you stop using it.|Endless: habits compound forever.|A tool that makes itself unnecessary is an honest and rare product.|email,productivity,coaching,habits",
"a092|Focus Session Logger|Productivity / Focus|flutter|tap|mono|Track what actually helps you focus, by logging sessions and conditions.|Log focus sessions with context: sleep, caffeine, music, time of day. The app finds your best conditions.|Finding your personal conditions beats generic productivity advice.|Endless: every session improves the model.|Personal experimentation is more useful than universal advice.|productivity,focus,experiments,insights",
"a093|Interruption Log|Work / Focus|flutter|tap|duotone|Count your interruptions, find the pattern, and then fix the cause.|One tap logs an interruption with a category. The app shows when and why you are being broken up.|Naming the cause is what enables the fix, and nobody measures this.|Endless: continuous.|Measurement precedes improvement, and this measures something nobody measures.|work,focus,measurement,insights",
"a094|Energy Audit|Wellness / Productivity|flutter|tap|pastel|Track what gives you energy and what takes it, across a week, and see the pattern.|Rate activities after doing them. The app builds an energy profile of your week.|Energy is a better planning unit than time, and nobody plans with it.|Endless: every week, forever.|Reframing planning around energy rather than time is a genuinely better model.|wellness,energy,planning,insights",
