"a097|Saying No Scripts|Social / Boundaries|flutter|typing|minimal|Scripts for declining things gracefully, tailored to who is asking and why.|Choose the relationship and the reason; the app drafts a decline that is kind and clear.|Kindness plus clarity is the hard combination, and templates rarely achieve both.|Endless: every request.|Drafting is more useful than advice, especially for difficult messages.|social,boundaries,communication,drafts",
"a098|Boundary Scripts|Social / Boundaries|flutter|typing|ink|What to say when someone crosses a line, at the moment it happens.|Pre-written, editable scripts for common boundary situations, organised by relationship type.|Having the words ready in advance is what makes boundaries possible under pressure.|Endless: every situation.|Preparation is the difference between having a boundary and enforcing one.|social,boundaries,communication,preparation",
"a099|Delegation Helper|Work / Management|flutter|typing|terminal|Turn a task you are hoarding into something someone else can actually do.|The app interviews you about a task and produces a complete brief with context and success criteria.|The interview is the product, because hoarding is usually about unstated context.|Endless: every task you delegate.|Extracting tacit knowledge is the real problem in delegation.|work,delegation,management,writing",
