"a101|Micro Workout|Fitness / Time|flutter|tap|neon|A workout that fits the gap you actually have, whether that is four minutes or forty.|You enter your available time and equipment. The app builds a session that fits exactly.|Fitting the workout to the gap rather than the gap to the workout is why people actually train.|Endless: infinite session generation from a movement library.|Designing around real constraints is what makes a fitness app get used.|fitness,time,generated,minimal",
"a102|One Minute Meditation|Wellness / Mindfulness|flutter|tap|pastel|Sixty seconds, guided, with no subscription and no spiritual preamble.|One tap starts a one-minute guided breath. The app tracks consistency, not duration.|Removing the time objection entirely is what makes meditation stick.|Endless: endless sessions, and the streak compounds.|Removing the barrier rather than motivating through it is the smarter design.|wellness,mindfulness,minimal,habits",
"a103|Breathing Pattern Designer|Wellness / Breathwork|flutter|drag|watercolor|Design your own breathing patterns and see what they do to your heart rate.|Drag to set inhale, hold and exhale lengths. The app guides you and optionally records heart rate response.|Letting people design and test patterns turns breathwork into an experiment.|Endless: infinite patterns to design and test.|Making the user a researcher rather than a follower is a strong reframe.|wellness,breathwork,experiments,design",
"a104|Habit Stack Builder|Wellness / Habits|flutter|tap|clay|Build habits by attaching them to things you already do, not by willpower.|You pick an existing routine and attach a new habit to it. The app tracks the chain, not the individual habit.|Anchoring to existing behaviour is the most evidence-based habit technique, and no app is built around it.|Endless: stacks grow indefinitely.|Basing the product on the actual evidence is a real differentiator.|habits,wellness,systems,behaviour",
"a105|Sleep Debt Ledger|Health / Sleep|flutter|tap|mono|Track your sleep debt like a bank balance, and see exactly what it costs you.|Log sleep. The app computes a running debt and correlates it with your mood and focus ratings.|Framing sleep as a debt with interest is more motivating than a score.|Endless: continuous tracking.|A better metaphor changes behaviour more than more data.|health,sleep,tracking,insights",
"a106|Nap Timer|Health / Sleep|flutter|tap|duotone|A nap timer that wakes you at the right point in your cycle, not after a fixed time.|Enter when you are lying down. The app estimates your cycle and wakes you at the lightest point.|Cycle-aware waking from a phone alone is a genuinely useful trick.|Endless: every nap.|A small piece of science applied well makes a simple timer valuable.|health,sleep,naps,timing",
"a107|Caffeine Curfew|Health / Sleep|flutter|tap|terminal|Tells you when to stop drinking coffee based on your actual bedtime and sensitivity.|Log caffeine intake. The app computes a personalised cutoff and warns you in the moment.|Personalised metabolism beats a generic rule, and the warning arrives when it matters.|Endless: daily.|Intervening at the moment of decision is what makes advice effective.|health,caffeine,sleep,timing",
"a108|Hydration by Weight|Health / Hydration|flutter|tap|minimal|Hydration targets based on your body, activity and the actual weather, not a generic eight glasses.|The app computes a target from weight, activity and temperature, and tracks intake with one tap.|Context-aware targets beat fixed rules and are easy to compute.|Endless: daily.|Personalising a universal recommendation is a small but real improvement.|health,hydration,daily,minimal",
"a109|Meal Photo Log|Nutrition / Tracking|flutter|camera|clay|Photograph every meal. No calorie counting, no guilt, just a visual record you can review.|One photo per meal, timestamped. The app shows your week as a photo grid and highlights patterns.|Photos are easier than logging and reveal patterns that numbers hide.|Endless: every meal, forever.|Reducing friction to a single photo is what makes nutrition logging survivable.|nutrition,tracking,camera,patterns",
"a110|Protein Target|Nutrition / Fitness|flutter|camera|neon|Hit your protein target with a live count and food suggestions that close the gap.|The app tracks protein from quick entries and suggests the smallest addition that hits the target.|Suggesting the specific next food is far more useful than showing a deficit.|Endless: daily, forever.|Closing the loop from tracking to action is what makes a tracker useful.|nutrition,fitness,protein,actionable",
"a111|Fasting Window|Nutrition / Fasting|flutter|tap|duotone|A fasting timer that adapts to your life instead of demanding a rigid schedule.|You set a window; the app adjusts it around events you add, and tracks how well you hold it.|Adapting the plan to reality is why this works where rigid fasting apps fail.|Endless: daily.|Flexibility is what makes a behaviour sustainable.|nutrition,fasting,adaptive,habits",
"a112|Gym Rest Timer|Fitness / Training|flutter|tap|neon|A rest timer that knows your programme and starts itself.|The app follows your workout and auto-starts rest periods, adjusting for the set you just did.|Removing the button press matters when your hands are full of barbell.|Endless: every session.|Eliminating a tiny friction in a high-attention moment is a real win.|fitness,gym,timer,automation",
"a113|Progressive Overload Tracker|Fitness / Strength|flutter|tap|terminal|Tells you exactly what to lift today, based on what you lifted last time.|The app calculates your next session from history and your chosen progression scheme.|Removing the arithmetic from progressive overload is the whole product.|Endless: every session, forever.|Doing the maths automatically is a complete and valuable product.|fitness,strength,progression,automation",
"a114|Form Check Camera|Fitness / Technique|flutter|camera|mono|Film a lift and get feedback on the two or three things that matter most.|The camera analyses key positions and gives prioritised cues, not a list of everything wrong.|Prioritising feedback is what makes coaching useful rather than overwhelming.|Endless: every lift, every session.|Good coaching is prioritisation, and software can prioritise.|fitness,technique,camera,coaching",
"a115|Run Route Generator|Fitness / Running|flutter|tap|isometric|Generates a running route with the exact distance and elevation you asked for.|Enter distance, elevation preference and start point. The app finds a route that matches.|Matching elevation and distance precisely is what makes route generation actually useful.|Endless: infinite routes from any start point.|Precise constraint satisfaction is a real technical improvement over 'nearby routes'.|fitness,running,routes,generated",
"a116|Walk Reward|Fitness / Motivation|flutter|tap|pastel|Every walk unlocks something small in a world that grows because you moved.|Steps convert into progress in a personal world. Walking is the only way to advance.|A persistent world that reflects your movement history is a strong motivational artefact.|Endless: the world grows forever.|Making the reward persistent and personal beats a badge.|fitness,walking,motivation,gamified",
"a117|Steps to Somewhere|Fitness / Exploration|flutter|tap|watercolor|Walk a virtual long-distance trail, one real step at a time.|Your steps advance a character along a real route with landmarks, photos and history.|Real geography plus real movement is a genuinely engaging combination.|Endless: hundreds of real trails, and you can repeat them.|Connecting daily movement to real geography gives it meaning.|fitness,walking,geography,exploration",
"a118|Chair Yoga|Wellness / Mobility|flutter|tap|pastel|Yoga you can do at a desk without anyone noticing.|Short sequences designed for seated, clothed, workplace conditions.|Designing for the actual context of use is what makes it usable.|Endless: endless sequences.|Context-specific design is a strong differentiator in a crowded category.|wellness,yoga,desk,accessibility",
