"a120|Eye Rest Timer|Health / Eyes|flutter|tap|minimal|Follows the twenty-twenty-twenty rule for you, with a nudge that is not annoying.|Every twenty minutes, the app prompts a twenty-second distance focus with a gentle visual guide.|Getting the interruption design right is what makes people keep it installed.|Endless: continuous.|The interruption design is the product, and most apps get it wrong.|health,eyes,breaks,minimal",
"a121|Mood Weather Report|Wellness / Mood|flutter|tap|watercolor|Log your mood as weather, and watch a climate form over months.|One tap records mood as a weather condition. The app charts your emotional climate over time.|Weather is a better metaphor than a number, and metaphors change how people report.|Endless: continuous.|A better input metaphor produces better data and better adherence.|wellness,mood,tracking,metaphor",
"a122|Anxiety Toolkit|Mental Health / Anxiety|flutter|tap|pastel|Five techniques that work, ready before you need them, with no searching.|The app presents a small set of techniques and walks you through one, chosen by your situation.|Being ready before the moment is the entire value, because searching mid-panic is impossible.|Endless: every anxious moment.|Preparedness is what makes a crisis tool useful.|mental-health,anxiety,crisis,tools",
"a123|Panic Button|Mental Health / Crisis|flutter|tap|duotone|One button, on the lock screen, that starts grounding immediately.|A single tap starts a guided grounding sequence with no menus and no decisions.|Removing all decisions from a crisis interface is the correct design.|Endless: always available.|Designing for the worst moment requires removing every obstacle.|mental-health,panic,grounding,accessibility",
