"a125|Worry Postponement|Mental Health / Anxiety|flutter|tap|clay|Write the worry down, schedule it, and get on with your day.|You capture worries into a queue. The app holds them until a scheduled worry time.|Postponement is a real clinical technique and no consumer app is built around it.|Endless: every worry.|Building a product around a specific clinical technique is a strong, honest niche.|mental-health,anxiety,technique,scheduling",
