"a127|Journaling Prompts Adaptive|Wellness / Journaling|flutter|typing|watercolor|Prompts that respond to what you have been writing about, and get deeper over time.|The app reads your entries and generates follow-up prompts that pursue your own threads.|Following the user's own threads is far better than a static prompt library.|Endless: infinite prompts derived from your own writing.|Deriving content from the user's own data is a strong personalisation strategy.|wellness,journaling,prompts,adaptive",
