"a130|Medication Adherence|Health / Medication|flutter|tap|terminal|Pill reminders that adapt to your actual routine instead of a fixed alarm.|The app learns when you actually take your medication and moves reminders to those windows.|Adapting to behaviour rather than demanding behaviour is what improves adherence.|Endless: every medication, every day.|Adaptive reminders outperform fixed ones, and this is measurable.|health,medication,adherence,adaptive",
