"a134|Cycle Tracking Deep|Health / Menstrual|flutter|tap|watercolor|Cycle tracking that models your hormones rather than just counting days.|The app tracks symptoms against cycle phases and predicts your personal patterns, not averages.|Personal pattern modelling beats population averages.|Endless: every cycle, forever.|Personalisation over averages is a genuine improvement.|health,cycle,tracking,personalised",
