"a141|Sleep Environment Audit|Health / Sleep|flutter|camera|mono|Find out why you sleep badly by measuring your bedroom.|The app uses phone sensors to measure light, noise and temperature overnight and suggests fixes.|Measuring the environment rather than the person is a fresh angle on sleep.|Endless: every room, every season.|Diagnosing the cause rather than tracking the symptom is a stronger approach.|health,sleep,environment,sensors",
